WEBVTT

00:01.770 --> 00:05.560
Mother, do you have a childhood friend?

00:05.810 --> 00:07.900
In Granada, Spain...

00:07.900 --> 00:10.940
I ran into Rosemary, a close childhood friend whom I haven't seen in a long time.

00:11.650 --> 00:14.070
No matter how far apart people are... or how much time passes...

00:14.410 --> 00:16.820
There's always something that'll never change, right?

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
NAAJA

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
Nadja,

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
With your eyes

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
Nadja,

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
NAAJA

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
What do you see?

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
Nani ga mieru

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Shining in the far distance,

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
The door to the future,

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
Mirai no tobira

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
That's what I'm searching for

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
Sagashite iru

00:43.560 --> 00:50.780
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
Minna egao de aetara

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
It could be so much more fun

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
I can't see the end of the journey

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
I will go waving

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
Te wo furinagara

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
But I won't look back

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
Nadja, Your smile

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
Nadja, gives me courage

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Under the blue sky,

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Aoi sora no shita de

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
I will find the place

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
Ashita no yukue

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
where my future lies

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
Mitsukeru kara

01:56.490 --> 02:00.450
﻿Dear Miss, Appleton, have you received any contact from Rosemary?

02:01.490 --> 02:03.780
﻿I've visited the estate where she's working, but...

02:03.830 --> 02:05.290
﻿They won't let me see her.

02:06.160 --> 02:08.120
﻿I'm not sure if she's got a lot of work as a maid...

02:08.420 --> 02:10.210
﻿or if her health isn't holding up...

02:10.580 --> 02:12.130
﻿I don't know the reason why...

02:15.170 --> 02:16.210
﻿That's...

02:17.300 --> 02:18.670
I'm ﻿very worried for her.

02:18.930 --> 02:21.300
﻿Miss Appleton, if you could also try to get in touch with her...

02:21.680 --> 02:22.970
﻿Nadja.

02:22.970 --> 02:23.200
Yes?

02:24.930 --> 02:25.560
﻿Hey.

02:26.270 --> 02:27.020
﻿Jose!

02:33.670 --> 02:38.680
A Wonderful Life!
The Man Who Saw The Light and the Shadow

02:42.620 --> 02:43.820
﻿Whose grave is this?

02:44.580 --> 02:46.580
﻿A matador by the name of Manolo.

02:47.750 --> 02:49.540
﻿He was a man who taught me a lot of things.

02:50.170 --> 02:51.670
Did he die in a bull fight?

02:51.670 --> 02:52.960
Yeah.

02:52.960 --> 02:54.590
He was strong, and had so much courage...

02:54.960 --> 02:57.300
﻿And was a wonderful person who loved his family.

02:58.050 --> 02:59.260
﻿Same as you then, huh?

03:07.810 --> 03:08.560
﻿Manolo...

03:09.230 --> 03:11.020
I've ﻿decided to get married.

03:11.940 --> 03:14.860
﻿I have a wife I love, and I'm doing well as a matador.

03:16.150 --> 03:17.860
﻿But, I feel so empty...

03:19.240 --> 03:20.700
﻿Living feels so void...

03:24.490 --> 03:25.320
﻿Jose!

03:29.000 --> 03:29.950
﻿Carmen!

03:31.250 --> 03:32.420
Long time no see!

03:32.420 --> 03:33.920
I'm so glad to see you again!

03:33.920 --> 03:35.210
O-Oh... yes...

03:36.210 --> 03:37.550
I'm also really surprised.

03:37.550 --> 03:39.210
﻿To run into you here...

03:39.320 --> 03:40.190
Really?

03:40.380 --> 03:42.510
﻿Have you two already had your wedding ceremony?

03:42.680 --> 03:43.590
﻿Not yet.

03:43.590 --> 03:44.470
﻿It's coming up soon.

03:44.680 --> 03:45.590
I ﻿see!

03:46.050 --> 03:48.060
﻿I wish the both of you lots of happiness!

03:50.640 --> 03:54.690
﻿I know! If you have some time, could you teach me more of the flamenco?

04:02.200 --> 04:04.280
Look, I'm able to do even that now!

04:04.610 --> 04:07.030
So, I'd just like to learn some new steps...

04:07.990 --> 04:11.080
﻿I'm sorry, but the two of us were about to go shopping.

04:11.330 --> 04:13.080
﻿Ah, I see... I'm sorry.

04:13.330 --> 04:14.330
﻿I didn't mean to intrude.

04:14.750 --> 04:16.330
﻿Well, teach me next time then, okay?

04:19.800 --> 04:21.590
﻿Please come and see my performance later!

04:21.860 --> 04:22.360
Yeah!

04:22.880 --> 04:23.920
﻿Do your best.

04:30.060 --> 04:32.100
Hey Carmen... do you remember?

04:32.600 --> 04:35.560
﻿What we talked about... the last time we came here.

04:40.190 --> 04:42.940
﻿There's nothing strange about a matador losing his life at any moment.

04:43.740 --> 04:45.990
﻿Carmen... if I die...

04:46.160 --> 04:47.620
﻿I'll die together with you.

04:49.450 --> 04:50.620
﻿I want to be together with you.

05:00.380 --> 05:01.840
﻿Of course I remember.

05:03.260 --> 05:04.800
I still hold the same feelings with me now.

05:10.220 --> 05:12.850
﻿Jose, I found the piece of jewelry that I want.

05:13.430 --> 05:15.480
﻿Well then, let's go to the store together.

05:16.060 --> 05:19.730
﻿I can't bring a hero like you to a store like that with me.

05:20.150 --> 05:24.110
﻿Then for the payment... Have the bill sent to the hotel addressed to me.

05:24.320 --> 05:25.360
﻿Tell the store to do so...

05:25.610 --> 05:27.860
﻿All right... then I'll do that.

05:41.040 --> 05:44.210
﻿Oh? So that matador's getting married?

05:45.970 --> 05:49.090
﻿The woman who's going to be his wife used to be a flamenco dancer, too!

05:49.260 --> 05:51.050
﻿So that's why you're in such high spirits.

05:51.560 --> 05:54.100
﻿I just want them to say that I've gotten better since they last saw me.

05:56.180 --> 05:58.230
﻿It looks quite well on you, madame.

06:00.110 --> 06:01.980
﻿I wish the both of you lots of happiness!

06:07.450 --> 06:09.490
﻿Excuse me, is something the matter?

06:10.780 --> 06:12.490
﻿Not at all. I'll take this..

06:13.080 --> 06:14.580
﻿and all of those.

06:14.830 --> 06:17.120
﻿Yes, madame. Thank you very much.

06:21.590 --> 06:23.290
﻿I wish the both of you lots of happiness!

06:35.470 --> 06:36.220
﻿Carmen.

07:04.090 --> 07:04.960
﻿What's wrong?

07:09.420 --> 07:10.800
﻿Nadja's dance is about to begin.

07:11.220 --> 07:11.800
﻿Let's go.

07:11.930 --> 07:12.890
﻿I don't want to

07:13.350 --> 07:14.050
﻿Why?

07:14.680 --> 07:17.100
﻿I don't want to... see her flamenco.

07:23.730 --> 07:26.110
﻿If you won't go, then I won't go either.

07:26.980 --> 07:28.860
﻿You can just go by yourself...

07:29.610 --> 07:31.150
﻿I want to be at your side.

08:09.530 --> 08:10.990
﻿If I die...

08:10.990 --> 08:12.030
﻿what will you do?

08:12.400 --> 08:13.900
﻿That same question again?

08:14.570 --> 08:16.280
﻿Of course, I'll die together with you.

08:17.950 --> 08:19.240
﻿Is that really all right?

08:21.250 --> 08:24.290
﻿Before, I was very happy when you said those words...

08:24.960 --> 08:25.920
﻿But now..

08:30.210 --> 08:32.260
﻿Then, what do you want me to do?!

08:35.800 --> 08:37.180
﻿What are you dissatisfied with?

08:37.350 --> 08:40.680
﻿What do you wish for?

08:41.140 --> 08:43.390
﻿No matter what I buy you, you always seem dissatisfied!

08:43.730 --> 08:45.310
﻿Just what do I have to do to satisfy you?

08:55.030 --> 08:56.240
﻿My wish...

08:57.200 --> 08:58.240
﻿Your wish...

09:03.910 --> 09:05.910
﻿Just what do I have to do to satisfy you?!

09:08.170 --> 09:09.080
﻿Carmen!

09:10.800 --> 09:13.960
﻿Thank goodness! I was just about to go visit you myself!

09:14.260 --> 09:16.090
﻿My performance just ended a little bit ago.

09:16.380 --> 09:18.550
﻿Really, the flamenco sure is difficult.

09:19.050 --> 09:21.560
﻿But, all of the audience looked really pleased by it.

09:21.720 --> 09:22.350
﻿So I'm relieved.

09:22.970 --> 09:25.230
﻿Jose and you didn't come, right?

09:25.520 --> 09:26.560
﻿What's wrong?

09:26.640 --> 09:28.650
﻿Did you have some sudden business come up?

09:28.770 --> 09:31.020
﻿Or could it be that one of you suddenly felt ill or something like that?

09:31.110 --> 09:32.110
﻿Shut up...

09:32.110 --> 09:33.440
﻿Huh?

09:34.490 --> 09:36.070
You're so a﻿nnoying!

09:36.070 --> 09:37.910
﻿Whenever I look at you, I get irritated!

09:39.280 --> 09:40.700
﻿Really irritated!

09:41.490 --> 09:44.700
﻿There's a mountain-load of dancers in this world who are better than you!

09:45.000 --> 09:46.540
Don't get so full of yourself!

09:46.830 --> 09:49.040
﻿I'm not getting full of myself at all!

09:49.130 --> 09:51.920
﻿No matter how much of the flamenco you can dance, it's all meaningless.

09:52.500 --> 09:53.880
﻿If you have the spare time to be dancing...

09:54.050 --> 09:57.340
﻿then it's much more worthwhile to get close to some loaded man!

09:58.720 --> 10:00.590
﻿This world is all about money!

10:00.850 --> 10:03.560
﻿If you're like me and marry a hero.

10:03.560 --> 10:05.060
then you can become, happy that way.

10:05.060 --> 10:07.100
﻿Could it be that... because of that reason, you and Jose are...

10:07.350 --> 10:08.440
﻿That's right!

10:09.150 --> 10:11.360
﻿I closed in on Jose for his money!

10:11.820 --> 10:14.440
﻿That was my intention from the beginning, so I used you!

10:14.940 --> 10:16.740
﻿Don't you love Jose?

10:16.740 --> 10:17.860
﻿Love?

10:20.240 --> 10:22.910
﻿People can get married, even without love.

10:24.560 --> 10:25.910
Gracias.

10:26.080 --> 10:30.540
﻿Nadja, thanks to you, I'll never have to worry about money in my life.

10:30.540 --> 10:32.790
I've become the happiest woman in the world!

10:34.210 --> 10:35.050
﻿What's your problem?!

10:35.050 --> 10:37.460
﻿Are you really happy like that?

10:41.680 --> 10:43.970
﻿Never show yourself before me again...

10:45.100 --> 10:46.270
﻿Carmen!

11:18.670 --> 11:20.220
﻿What should I do...?

11:20.970 --> 11:23.300
﻿I closed in on Jose for his money!

11:23.680 --> 11:25.890
﻿If Jose learns of this..

11:27.020 --> 11:29.310
I﻿'ve always prayed to God.

11:29.600 --> 11:30.930
﻿I want to die soon.

11:31.270 --> 11:33.600
﻿Please hurry and take this life of mine!

11:34.860 --> 11:37.320
﻿He might gain thoughts of wanting to die again...

11:39.940 --> 11:41.700
﻿Isn't it about time for you to take a little break?

11:41.820 --> 11:44.030
﻿Professional dancers always prepare and dedicate themselves to the real performance,

11:44.030 --> 11:45.910
﻿but they get the amount of rest they need as well.

11:46.160 --> 11:47.280
﻿Dancers?

11:47.540 --> 11:49.080
﻿You're a dancer, aren't you?

11:52.540 --> 11:53.750
﻿A dancer...

11:59.340 --> 12:01.760
﻿What I can do as a dancer...

12:05.140 --> 12:05.970
﻿Jose!

12:07.200 --> 12:07.950
You're...

12:09.930 --> 12:12.940
﻿It's not good for your body if you drink too much alcohol...

12:15.650 --> 12:16.770
﻿What would you do?

12:18.320 --> 12:20.320
﻿If someone you loved died...

12:20.780 --> 12:21.780
what would you do?

12:24.050 --> 12:24.760
Well?

12:28.450 --> 12:30.290
﻿I'm sorry... I asked you a weird question.

12:30.390 --> 12:31.310
I'd...

12:32.040 --> 12:34.080
﻿want my loved one to stay well.

12:34.460 --> 12:37.210
﻿Even if I'd be gone, I'd want my loved one to live on.

12:37.590 --> 12:40.210
﻿That's why I think I'd try my best...

12:40.380 --> 12:41.760
﻿to live on to tomorrow for that person.

12:42.380 --> 12:43.090
﻿Tomorrow?

12:43.550 --> 12:46.180
﻿Even if there's sadness and hardships...

12:46.550 --> 12:48.430
﻿tomorrow will always come.

12:48.850 --> 12:52.270
﻿Even if I'm sad today, I'm sure something happy will come tomorrow.

12:52.600 --> 12:54.640
﻿I believe in tomorrow.

12:55.520 --> 12:56.940
﻿Believing in tomorrow..

13:04.360 --> 13:06.740
﻿Jose, please come see my flamenco.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.490
﻿I'll be dancing for the both of you.

13:08.990 --> 13:09.910
﻿Why?

13:09.910 --> 13:13.540
﻿Thanks to you, I was able to dance the flamenco!

13:13.870 --> 13:15.500
﻿So, I want you to watch me.

13:16.540 --> 13:18.290
﻿I'll be waiting by the mechanical car, okay?

13:47.280 --> 13:48.410
﻿What are you looking at?!

13:48.990 --> 13:50.320
﻿Go ahead and laugh at me.

13:50.450 --> 13:52.660
﻿To be unable to complete even one dance...

13:52.790 --> 13:53.870
﻿You want to laugh at me, don't you?

13:54.140 --> 13:54.890
Carmen...

13:55.120 --> 13:56.750
﻿Please come see my flamenco.

13:58.000 --> 13:59.620
﻿What are you saying?

13:59.920 --> 14:00.880
﻿I want you to watch me.

14:01.210 --> 14:03.460
﻿Why do I have to go and see a dance like yours?

14:03.800 --> 14:06.630
﻿When I first saw your dance, Carmen...

14:06.920 --> 14:08.180
﻿I thought it was truly amazing.

14:12.180 --> 14:13.640
I ﻿was really moved by it.

14:13.970 --> 14:18.020
﻿At that time, I thought I want to be able to dance just like you, Carmen.

14:18.440 --> 14:20.400
﻿I want the dancer that I admire to watch me!

14:20.900 --> 14:23.730
﻿I still have a long way before I can match your pace yet, but...

14:26.570 --> 14:28.360
﻿I'll be waiting at the mechanical car, okay?

14:45.630 --> 14:46.880
﻿Thank you for coming!

14:47.260 --> 14:49.510
﻿Please watch... my flamenco!

14:58.350 --> 14:59.520
﻿Our love...

14:59.810 --> 15:01.480
﻿has been over for some time, hasn't it?

15:03.360 --> 15:06.400
﻿I thought if you were at my side, I'd be content again, but...

15:06.480 --> 15:07.900
﻿It wasn't like that.

15:07.900 --> 15:11.360
﻿Both you... and I have different wishes.

15:21.000 --> 15:23.290
﻿When I first saw Nadja's flamenco,

15:23.790 --> 15:25.500
﻿it reminded me of your past self.

15:26.000 --> 15:28.170
﻿Back when you were so engrossed in your dancing.

15:34.890 --> 15:35.970
I was just like that too.

15:36.510 --> 15:38.220
﻿I loved bull fighting so much,

15:38.720 --> 15:40.930
﻿that the fierce training didn't affect me one bit.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.390
I ﻿had forgotten.

15:42.850 --> 15:43.980
﻿The way I was back then...

15:47.780 --> 15:49.150
﻿We used to have it too...

15:49.690 --> 15:50.780
﻿Just like that girl...

15:51.150 --> 15:52.650
﻿A time when we were so full of life!

16:07.940 --> 16:09.090
Hey, Carmen...

16:09.090 --> 16:10.340
what is it that you wish for?

16:12.180 --> 16:13.760
What you want isn't me.

16:14.070 --> 16:15.550
Nor is it money.

16:15.550 --> 16:17.640
﻿You have something you love even more than both of those.

16:17.850 --> 16:18.850
Speak for yourself.

16:19.220 --> 16:21.020
﻿Your wish isn't me, either.

16:21.270 --> 16:22.930
﻿You have a dream you want to come true.

16:23.190 --> 16:24.560
﻿Don't you?

16:24.560 --> 16:25.770
﻿Let's dissolve this engagement.

16:28.360 --> 16:29.270
﻿Yes, let's.

16:33.490 --> 16:34.910
﻿W-Wait a second!

16:35.410 --> 16:37.950
﻿Nadja, go and train to your utmost.

16:39.370 --> 16:41.830
﻿Once I start dancing the flamenco seriously,

16:42.160 --> 16:44.080
﻿I'll cause an even greater applause than the one you got.

16:44.250 --> 16:46.580
﻿Soon enough, I'll have everyone fall under my spell,

16:46.710 --> 16:49.000
﻿and make them take no notice of someone like you.

16:51.210 --> 16:52.130
﻿Gracias.

16:53.050 --> 16:53.840
﻿Carmen!

16:55.180 --> 16:57.220
﻿Jose, is it all right not to chase after her?!

16:57.600 --> 16:58.350
﻿It's all right.

16:58.850 --> 16:59.550
﻿But...!

16:59.760 --> 17:01.930
﻿Nadja, could you join me for a minute?

17:05.100 --> 17:06.350
﻿What are you doing?

17:08.610 --> 17:09.810
﻿Building a grave.

17:10.020 --> 17:11.020
﻿For me and Carmen.

17:11.610 --> 17:12.440
﻿A grave?

17:13.150 --> 17:15.860
﻿Why? Both of you are still alive...

17:16.030 --> 17:18.990
﻿The ones I'm burying are our past selves.

17:21.160 --> 17:22.990
﻿I believe that we died.

17:23.410 --> 17:24.540
﻿I, as a matador.

17:24.710 --> 17:28.670
﻿And Carmen, whose heart died after having lost her passion for flamenco.

17:28.920 --> 17:32.500
That's why we ere bot hurting so much and relying on each other...

17:33.630 --> 17:35.300
﻿But, after seeing your flamenco,

17:35.590 --> 17:37.090
we've been reborn.

17:37.890 --> 17:41.810
Thanks to you, we finally remembered... what it was that's important to us.

17:42.220 --> 17:43.390
﻿What's important...?

17:47.650 --> 17:49.350
﻿I wanted to become the Sun.

17:50.110 --> 17:53.650
﻿When I was a kid and saw my first bull fight.

17:54.070 --> 17:56.280
﻿That fighting matador bathing in the sunlight...

17:56.490 --> 17:57.820
I ﻿saw him as the Sun.

17:58.410 --> 18:01.160
﻿And so, I thought I wanted to become a matador just like him.

18:01.280 --> 18:03.490
﻿That was my dream.

18:05.330 --> 18:08.250
﻿I... when I first saw your bull fight, Jose...

18:08.540 --> 18:11.330
﻿I thought, "This person is just like the Sun."

18:13.710 --> 18:16.970
﻿A matador who wishes of death for himself isn't the Sun at all.

18:17.630 --> 18:20.840
﻿The sun in the sky isn't always shining down upon us, is it?

18:21.510 --> 18:23.140
﻿There are times when it's hidden by the clouds.

18:23.810 --> 18:25.600
﻿But even so, you still are the Sun!

18:25.980 --> 18:27.350
﻿You can always shine!

18:31.610 --> 18:33.060
﻿Gracias, Nadja.

18:39.160 --> 18:40.070
﻿That bull...

18:40.160 --> 18:41.530
﻿It sure is a wild one.

18:42.990 --> 18:44.910
﻿Jose, go in with prudence.

18:47.120 --> 18:49.160
﻿Jose. Hey! Are you listening?

18:49.460 --> 18:50.710
﻿It sure is a nice day out today.

18:51.920 --> 18:54.460
The sky's blue, and there's not a single cloud in it.

18:54.920 --> 18:56.590
﻿The sun is so full of life!

18:58.920 --> 18:59.510
﻿I'm going out!

19:01.010 --> 19:02.930
﻿Jose just smiled, didn't he?

19:03.140 --> 19:04.930
﻿At a time like this, when he's about to go fight...

19:05.970 --> 19:08.480
﻿Hey, Jose! This isn't the time to be smiling!

19:11.650 --> 19:13.230
﻿Jose! Focus!

19:13.900 --> 19:15.940
﻿I beg of you, please keep a grip on yourself!

19:16.320 --> 19:18.110
﻿If you're not careful, it'll mean your life out there!

19:26.240 --> 19:27.620
I'm ﻿living right now.

19:28.080 --> 19:29.660
﻿And I've got time yet to live!

19:30.710 --> 19:33.710
﻿Even if I'm in despair, and my heart's died...

19:34.340 --> 19:36.420
﻿If I believe in tomorrow, I can be reborn.

19:38.510 --> 19:40.920
﻿Any person can always regain their brilliance.

19:41.760 --> 19:43.130
﻿The one who taught me that...

19:45.050 --> 19:47.180
﻿was you, who reached out for me in the darkness...

19:48.560 --> 19:49.140
﻿You yourself...

19:49.430 --> 19:50.730
﻿are the real Sun!

19:51.390 --> 19:52.690
﻿A-Amazing!

19:52.690 --> 19:54.100
